--- Architecture (provider-seam, mirrors the DrivetrainHealth precedent) ---
Pure (Foundation-only, host-testable): TirePressureReading + TirePressureMath + TireCorner +
  TirePressureUnit; TirePressureStatus thresholds; TirePressureProjection (summary/series/table/
  range filter). @Observable TirePressurePageModel (Observation only) republishes a
  TirePressureViewState from an injected TirePressureDataProvider. LiveTirePressureProvider
  (#if canImport(Shared)) binds the KMP VehiclesStore.vehicles + VehicleSystemsStore.tirePressure /
  .tirePressureHistory feeds via FlowBridge + LoadableState (SI on the wire; display conversion at
  the boundary). SwiftUI sections use only the P3 component library + P2 design tokens.

